<div class="how-section main container">
    <hgroup>
        <h3>How it Works</h3>
        <p>It's really simple!</p>
        <article id="instructions">
            <ol type="1">
                <li>Log into Spotify</li>
                <li>
                    Upload a folder containing MP3 or WAV files (100 or less for
                    best results).
                </li>
                <li>
                    Enter the name of a new playlist or an existing Spotify
                    playlist.
                </li>
                <li>Hit 'Harvest' and let it do its thing.</li>
                <li>
                    AudioReaper will then try adding your tracks to the
                    specified playlist.
                </li>
            </ol>
        </article>
    </hgroup>
    <div class="container">
        <p>Scroll down to get started.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    #instructions ol {
        color: var(--text);
    }
</style>
